msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/security-and-trust-boundaries.md:12
msgid "Runtime to private operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/security-and-trust-boundaries.md:12
msgid ""
"Live lease/scope intersection, registered schema/effect checks, digest-"
"bound review and rechecks around side effects; uncertain effects remain "
